### ============================================================
### Mall Cloud — 管理后台全量接口文档（附请求/响应示例）
### 按模块区分的完整接口表
### ============================================================

@ADMIN = http://localhost:8030
@BFF = http://localhost:8090
@BASIC = http://localhost:8022
@PRODUCT = http://localhost:8023
@MARKETING = http://localhost:8024
@ORDER = http://localhost:8026
@INVENTORY = http://localhost:8036
@MESSAGE = http://localhost:8028

### ============================================================
### Step 0：获取 Token
### ============================================================

# @name login
POST {{ADMIN}}/v1/auth/user/testLogin
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"admin123"}

### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"token":"eyJhbG...","user":{"id":13,"userName":"admin"}}}

### ============================================================
### 系统管理（用户/角色/部门/岗位/菜单）
### ============================================================

### 1. 用户分页查询
POST {{BFF}}/admin/v1/user/page
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{"entity":{},"page":{"pageNum":1,"pageSize":10}}
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"totalCount":3,"pageNo":1,"pageSize":10,"totalPage":1,"list":[{"id":13,"userName":"admin","phone":"182****6777","email":"12lisu@163.com","deptName":"运营部","validStatus":true,"isDel":0,"createTime":"2024-01-22"}]}}

### 2. 按ID查询单个用户
POST {{BFF}}/admin/v1/user/findByIds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}、

[13]
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":[{"id":13,"userName":"admin","phone":"182****6777","email":"12lisu@163.com","validStatus":true,"isDel":0}]}

### 3. 按手机号查询用户
GET {{BFF}}/admin/v1/user/findByPhone?phone=13959758081
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"id":2077676246750052352,"userName":"姚铭烨","phone":"13959758081","email":"yaomingye55@gmail.com"}}

### 4. 新增用户
POST {{ADMIN}}/v1/auth/user/insert
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{"userName":"testuser","phone":"13800000001","email":"test@t.com","password":"123456","deptId":1,"jobId":1,"status":1}
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"rows":1}}

### 5. 修改用户
POST {{ADMIN}}/v1/auth/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

{"id":1,"email":"new@t.com","status":1}
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"rows":1}}

### 6. 删除用户
POST {{ADMIN}}/v1/auth/user/deleteByIds
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.token}}

[999]
### 响应: {"code":200,"data":{"rows":1}}

